  "description": "The browser half of Inkwell's shared dice table: a Blazor component-model channel over a\n      peer-to-peer room, with the JavaScript transport shipped alongside it as a static web asset.\n      There is no server and no account — a table code is the whole of it, private rolls are ghosted\n      before anything leaves the machine, and every message from another browser is refused unless\n      it is exactly a roll or a name.",
